      "created_at": "2015-08-24T17:55:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If I don't have Master of Magic, Amulet of the Elder Gods, or Starshield Necklace in hand but I do have a Heedless Lash I'll play it just for the chance to get one of them immediately in play. &nbsp; Doesn't always pan out but it's great when it does&nbsp;</p>",
