    {
      "id": 146716,
      "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
      "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-08-25T07:30:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I like the spellbook. &nbsp;It's useful when you haven't gotten any of your healing magic and want a way to refill on cards without completely destroying your health. &nbsp;The ring is... often more trouble than it's worth. &nbsp;But it works well with the promo too, since you're far more likely to be taking damage only once a turn, which means that you redirect all the damage you deal towards your enemies.</p>",
