      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_burning_stickman/{size}/2003_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-08-25T14:37:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I've almost never needed the tome, and usually use it as healing or effect fodder. I've found usually I've got a surplus of spells, and what I need is the ongoings or relics -- I can't tell you how often my opening hand is something like three Oblivions and a Heedless Lash.</p><p>I need to practice more with DW Nightmist, because by the time my next turn comes up, I keep forgetting what I put on top.</p>",
