      "username": "mlangsdorf",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/c4cdca/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-08-27T00:45:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm really fond of using the Tome when I've already played a Lash or Oblivion during the turn and done my redirection, and don't feel like eating the (usually enhanced) damage from Investigate. It's the second artifact I play when I have a choice of artifacts.</p><p>I'm also deficient in using Astral Premonition, finding that I have other uses for my discards and powers. It's nifty, but I don't feel I can justify it normally.</p>",
